# Reference data: offices, senders, companies, contacts, templates, suppressions, calendars,
# leads, notifications, outbox and sending settings. Creation examples are in 04-engine.http.

@token = PASTE-AN-ADMIN-DEV-TOKEN
@officeId = PASTE-AN-OFFICE-ID
@senderId = PASTE-A-SENDER-ID
@companyId = PASTE-A-COMPANY-ID
@contactId = PASTE-A-CONTACT-ID
@templateId = PASTE-A-TEMPLATE-ID
@leadId = PASTE-A-LEAD-ID

### Offices
GET {{baseUrl}}/offices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One office
GET {{baseUrl}}/offices/{{officeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pause one office's sending (its emails are deferred until resumed)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/offices/{{officeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sending_paused": true, "signature": "Forwarder UAE | Dubai"}

### Senders of an office
GET {{baseUrl}}/senders?office_id={{officeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change a mailbox's daily cap / clear a "blocked" flag
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/senders/{{senderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"daily_cap": 40, "clear_flag": true}

### Companies (search by name or domain)
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?q=gulf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One company with branches
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Freeze a company (every office stops emailing all its branches)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"frozen": true, "frozen_reason": "Existing customer of our Spain office"}

### Add a branch
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: branch-riyadh-1

{"name": "Riyadh branch", "country": "SA", "city": "Riyadh"}

### Contacts (filter by text, tag, company, stage)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts?tag=intro&stage=new
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One contact
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a contact
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"job_title": "Head of Logistics", "timezone": "Asia/Dubai"}

### Remove a tag
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}/tags/intro
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The contact's email history (sent and received)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Templates (optionally one key, all languages)
GET {{baseUrl}}/templates?key=intro
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One template
GET {{baseUrl}}/templates/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Edit a template
PUT {{baseUrl}}/templates/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"subject": "Shipping to {{company.name}}", "body": "Hello {{contact.first_name|there}},\n\n{{sender.name}}\n{{office.name}}"}

### Delete a template version
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/templates/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Suppressions
# @name suppressions
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppressions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Suppress an address for 30 days
POST {{baseUrl}}/suppressions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: suppress-1

{"email": "someone@example.com", "reason": "manual", "note": "Asked to pause until next month", "expires_at": "2026-10-29T00:00:00Z"}

### Lift a suppression
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/suppressions/{{suppressions.response.body.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Country calendars (built-in defaults plus tenant overrides)
GET {{baseUrl}}/country-calendars
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Override a country's calendar (ISO weekdays: 1 = Monday ... 7 = Sunday)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/country-calendars/AE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"timezone": "Asia/Dubai", "weekend_days": [6, 7], "extra_holidays": ["2026-12-02", "2026-12-03"], "extra_workdays": []}

### Leads for pricing
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads?status=new
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One lead
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Move a lead along
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "quoting", "priority": "high"}

### Notifications (owner, pricing, Teams)
# @name notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?unread=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark one read
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{notifications.response.body.items[0].id}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Outbox (dev/staging): every email the dry-run provider "sent"
# @name outbox
GET {{baseUrl}}/outbox?contact_id={{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One outbox email with headers (Message-ID, In-Reply-To, List-Unsubscribe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/outbox/{{outbox.response.body.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sending settings (kill switch and window)
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings/sending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Kill switch: pause every email of the tenant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/settings/sending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sending_paused": true}

### Resume, and change the window (recipient's local time)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/settings/sending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sending_paused": false, "sending_window_start": "09:00", "sending_window_end": "11:30"}

### Unsubscribe confirmation page (public; the token comes from an email's List-Unsubscribe
### header). Opening it never unsubscribes: link scanners open links.
GET {{baseUrl}}/unsubscribe/PASTE-A-TOKEN

### RFC 8058 one-click POST (what mail clients send)
POST {{baseUrl}}/unsubscribe/PASTE-A-TOKEN
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

List-Unsubscribe=One-Click

### Dashboard numbers (7, 30 or 90 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Funnel, results per destination country, reply heatmap (office time)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/insights?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Latest activity: emails sent, replies, bounces, new leads
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/activity?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Import contacts from CSV (matched by email; `tag` starts the workflows listening to it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts/import
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: contacts-import-001
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=LaneReach

--LaneReach
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tag"

air-intro
--LaneReach
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="contacts.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

email,first_name,company,country,language,network,office,tags
deniz@ist-cargo.example,Deniz,IST Cargo,TR,tr,WCA,UAE,vip
--LaneReach--

### Export leads as CSV (opens in Excel)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads/export?status=new
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark a lead won (publishes lead.status_changed: "Lead status changed" workflows start)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "won"
}

### An office's signature picture (PNG/JPEG); HTML emails end with it
POST {{baseUrl}}/offices/{{officeId}}/signature-image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: office-signature-001
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=LaneReach

--LaneReach
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="signature.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./samples/signature.png
--LaneReach--

### Back to the text signature
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/offices/{{officeId}}/signature-image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### An agent's signature picture (switches the agent to image mode)
POST {{baseUrl}}/senders/{{senderId}}/signature-image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: agent-signature-001
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=LaneReach

--LaneReach
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="signature.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./samples/signature.png
--LaneReach--
